"meta":{"kind":"counterspell-catalog","pf2eVersion":"8.6.1","note":"M4: counterspell reactions (onEvent spell-cast near + counter). Phase 1 entries spend no slot; phase 2 (M4.9) entries carry counter.expend = the spell slot or prepared spell that is spent (the group: Counterspell and its NPC copies, Scoff at the Divine, Counter Thought, Counter Escape, Flexible/Troop/Master's Counterspell, Spellstealing Counter, Life to Unlife, Dueling Counter; 30 documents). Keys are exact compendium sources; values from item text (tools/out/items.json descEn). range \"any\" = no distance limit in the text (walls still count). onCounter/onFail/immunity: consequences by outcome (counteracted / not counteracted); to \"target\" = the caster. Left manual (counter replaced by something else or not a spell-cast trigger): Bloodstone Doll x3, Reflect Spell, Recognize the Spell, Spellsurge, Mythic Counterspell, Interfering Surge, Countercharm, Challenge Insight. Debt of expend entries: Troop Counterspell +2 status bonus and Master's Counterspell -2 penalty to the check (add in the roll dialog), Scoff at the Divine \"1d4 rounds\" pause, Dueling \"in a duel\", Counter Escape \"or as a reaction\", Spellstealing \"fewer than three spells stored\". Confiscate Spell and Menace to Magic: the text gives no rank, so half the level rounded up is used by the general rule."},
